            public_bio: "Prudence runs the cockpit, handles navigation, and manages jump monitoring. During self-generated transit she is one of two crew fully conscious — watching the crossing, keeping the Loup-Garou on course through the dark. She does this with total, unperformed attention and is faintly impatient with anything that wastes it.",
